### Scraper + Redis persistence checks
### Usage:
### - Install VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### - Fill variables below, then run requests in order
### - IMPORTANT: to validate Redis (not in-memory), do the "API restart" step and re-run the status request

@baseUrl = https://api.corretto.pro/scraper
@email = dev4@example.com
@websiteUrl = https://topflysolutions.com/
@maxUrls = 30

### =============================================================
### 0) Optional: discover candidate URLs
### =============================================================
# @name discoverUrls
POST {{baseUrl}}/research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "website_url": "{{websiteUrl}}",
  "max_urls": {{maxUrls}}
}

### =============================================================
### 1) Start scraping job (this writes initial job state)
### =============================================================
# NOTE: incolla qui 1-3 URL reali presi da discoverUrls (o scelti manualmente)
# @name startJob
POST {{baseUrl}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "website_url": "{{websiteUrl}}",
  "urls": [
    "https://topflysolutions.com",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/articoli",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/esempi-di-applicazioni",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/la-nostra-azienda",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/exhibitions",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/i-nostri-marchi",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/lavora-con-noi",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/contattaci",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/rete-di-installazione",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/richiesta-demo-prezzo",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/tempo-reale-e-storico",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/passeggeri",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/centralina-e-anomalie-veicolo",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/tachigrafo-e-infrazioni",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/carburante",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/autisti",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/missioni",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/costi-e-manutenzione",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/cassoni-e-rimorchi",
    "https://topflysolutions.com/antifurto-completo"
  ]
}

### =============================================================
### 2) Poll status (repeat until progress updates)
### =============================================================
# @name statusBeforeRestart
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/{{email}}

### =============================================================
### 3) Redis verification: restart API, then read status again
### =============================================================
# MANUAL STEP (outside this .http file): restart the API process/container.
# - If API is running via uvicorn locally: stop it and start it again.
# - If API is running via docker compose: `docker compose restart api`
#
# Expected outcome:
# - The response should still contain the last known `status/progress`.
# - If it resets to 404 "job not found" (or loses progress), Redis is not being used.
#
# @name statusAfterRestart
GET {{baseUrl}}/status/{{email}}

### =============================================================
### 4) Optional: check Qdrant collection status (when job completes)
### =============================================================
# @name collectionStatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/collection/{{email}}

### =============================================================
### 5) Optional: cleanup (delete collection)
### =============================================================
# WARNING: this deletes the Qdrant collection for the service.
# @name deleteCollection
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/collection/{{email}}
